sn12.18:3.3 | P: ‘Kiṁ nu kho, bho gotama, sayaṅkatañca paraṅkatañca sukhadukkhan’ti iti puṭṭho samāno ‘mā hevaṁ, timbarukā’ti vadesi. | T: or ‘Are they created by both?’
sn12.18:3.4 | P: ‘Kiṁ pana, bho gotama, asayaṅkāraṁ aparaṅkāraṁ adhiccasamuppannaṁ sukhadukkhan’ti iti puṭṭho samāno ‘mā hevaṁ, timbarukā’ti vadesi. | T: or ‘Are they created by neither?’ in each case you say: ‘Not so, Timbaruka.’
